            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Now 2.10.46

- Added an optional Chrome extension that provides real previous and next YouTube Music artwork during trackpad swipes.
- Added a private, localhost-only bridge between the extension and the native app.
- Made swipe gestures responsive across every music source, including Apple Music, with a graceful elastic fallback when queue artwork is unavailable.
- Added guided Chrome-extension installation to Settings and bundled the extension inside the app.
]]></description>
