            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Now 2.10.45

- Captures every adjacent-artwork probe outcome, including Chrome errors and timeouts.
- Writes separate next and previous queue reports so one direction cannot overwrite the other.
- Records started, resolved, empty, malformed, injected-diagnostic, and execution-error stages.
]]></description>
