            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Now 2.10.44

- Adds isolated diagnostics for failed YouTube Music adjacent-artwork lookups.
- Records page-world access, playlist state, queue-store structure, and rendered-row counts.
- Writes the report to Application Support without changing playback detection or animation.
]]></description>
